},"attributedDescription":{"content":"It's off to Merseyside for the final two Podcasts of Correspondent Week and on the penultimate episode of the week it's The Reds, now under Andon Iraola, and new Liverpool Correspondent Lauren Harris joins James to discuss the FPL assets of interest and what to expect next.\n\nMaybe clean sheets aren't expected. But the case is put for and against investment and whether Virgil Van Dijk or Milos Kerkez should be preferred.\n\nAlexander Isak is fit, maybe the answer to the Florian Wirtz or Domink Szoboszlai dilemma is to get both and there may be some cheaper options for consideration too.\n\nBut can Liverpool be successful with a renewed high energy game plan when the squad clearly needs reinforcements?\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntro: 0:00\nSlot: 1:24\nIraola \u0026 Tactics: 2:27\nFixtures: 8:09\nDepartures: 12:00\nSignings: 19:10\nIsak: 27:20\nWirtz v Szoboszlai: 30:12\nOther Midfielders: 34:56\nVan Dijk or Kerkez: 41:28\nOther Defenders: 46:56\nGoalkeepers: 48:12\nPredicted GW1 XI: 48:58\nSeason Expectations: 52:19\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nNext on Correspondent Week: ep. 20 with Sean Norton on Everton\n\nAnd on Patreon: The Debrief with Suj and James on today's four Podcasts (IT+) and After The Podcast with today's Correspondents (AT)\n\nNext Week on Planet FPL:\n\nMonday: s. 10 ep. 3 - The Shortlist\n\nTuesday: That Show With Nico ep. 16\n\nWednesday: s. 10 ep. 4 - The Line Ups\n\nThursday: Ask James\n\nFriday: s. 10 ep. 5 - Final Drafts\n\nThe full schedule for Correspondent Week can be found here: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  / correspondent-166192123⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  \n\nWant to become a member of our FPL community and support the Podcast? \n\nJoin us on Patreon: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  / planetfpl⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠...  \n\nFollow James on Twitter/x: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  / planetfplpod⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠...  \n\nFollow Suj on Twitter/x: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  / sujanshah⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠...  \n\nFollow Clayton on Twitter/x: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  / claytsafc⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠...  \n\nFollow Nico on Twitter/x: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  / nico_semedo⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  \n\nSubscribe to our YouTube channel: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠   / @planetfpl  \n\nLike us on Facebook: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  / planetfpl⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠...  \n\nFollow us on Instagram: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠  / planetfpl⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠...  \n\n#FantasyPremierLeague #FPL #LFC","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":796,"length":4,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CJgCEM2rARgBIhMIzLe_kParlgMVmBizBR0JASBnygEECGe84g==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=-v8Ad3qhY80","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"-v8Ad3qhY80","continuePlayback":true,"startTimeSeconds":0,"watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieConfig":{"commonConfig":{"url":"https://rr3---sn-a5meknzr.googlevideo.com/initplayback?source=youtube\u0026oeis=1\u0026c=WEB\u0026oad=3200\u0026ovd=3200\u0026oaad=11000\u0026oavd=11000\u0026ocs=700\u0026oewis=1\u0026oputc=1\u0026olis=1\u0026ofpcc=1\u0026msp=1\u0026odepv=1\u0026id=faff00777aa163cd\u0026ip=68.255.249.182\u0026initcwndbps=2273750\u0026mt=1787115684\u0026oweuc="}}}}}},"onTapOptions":{"accessibilityInfo":{"accessibilityLabel":"0 seconds"}}},{"startIndex":807,"length":4,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CJgCEM2rARgBIhMIzLe_kParlgMVmBizBR0JASBnygEECGe84g==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=-v8Ad3qhY80\u0026t=84s","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"-v8Ad3qhY80","continuePlayback":true,"startTimeSeconds":84,"watchEndpoin